	"talks": [
		{
			"id": 7000102,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7000102
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7000102",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7000102,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Vile"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 700010201,
					"content": "Why, if it isn't the Traveler. We meet again. How are you finding the city's atmosphere?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010202,
					"content": "It's pretty good.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700010203,
					"content": "And it's good that you think so. Still... this might not quite fit in with the festive mood, but perhaps you might be able to help me with something related to the festival.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010204,
					"content": "Well, more accurately, \"that gentleman\" would like your help in this matter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010205,
					"content": "I thought people didn't go around asking others to do stuff during the Windblume Festival...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700010206,
					"content": "Ah, don't fret. This request does not fall within the usual strictures of the festival.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010207,
					"content": "As you've surely noticed, the Windblume Festival is a most busy time. People come and go, hustle and bustle... Almost everyone's completely immersed in the festive mood. The Knights will be too busy maintaining order to pay any attention to anything else...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010208,
					"content": "Defenseless crowds, overworked Knights... To ones such as the Treasure Hoarders, this must surely be a great opportunity.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010209,
					"content": "According to intelligence from that gentleman, some Treasure Hoarders have already infiltrated the city in all the hubbub, and are currently amidst the shops, pretending to enjoy the festival, when they are simply laying the groundwork for future operations.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010210,
					"content": "If the Knights begin a large-scale search now, they will not only alert the Treasure Hoarders but also ruin the atmosphere. Yet we cannot leave these criminals be...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010211,
					"content": "And this is where I come in.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700010212,
					"content": "Of course. That gentleman specifically asked for you in this case, too. According to him, you're the best person for the job.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010213,
					"content": "Alright then, let's get to the heart of things. According to the intelligence that I've gathered, the infiltrating Treasure Hoarders all carry <color=#00E1FFFF>a pouch</color> to help identify each other, and will use a <color=#00E1FFFF>code</color> to confirm their comrades' identities.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010214,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>When the wind blows the flowers about — that's when bystanders should watch out.</color>",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010215,
						700010216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010215,
					"content": "Pretty easy to remember.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010217
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700010217,
					"content": "Those who can recite this code would be our infiltrators. You should be able to get the location of their outdoor base from them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010218,
					"content": "Once you have that intel in hand, please take the opportunity to take care of all of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010219,
					"content": "And the Knights can't help with this?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010220
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700010220,
					"content": "Why, they must be at their wits' end just trying to maintain order during the festival.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010221,
					"content": "At times like these, it's the duty of concerned citizens to... share the load a little.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010222,
					"content": "Well, we're counting on you, Honorary Knight.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Vile"
				},
				{
					"id": 700010216,
					"content": "Sounds like their style.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700010217
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7000103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7000103
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
